#: admin/class-admin-firewall.php:680
msgid "The Web Application Firewall inspects every front-end request (URL, body, user-agent) against attack signatures — SQL injection, XSS, path traversal, command injection — and blocks the request before it reaches your site. Engine and baseline rules are free on every plan."
msgstr "Die Web Application Firewall prüft jede Frontend-Anfrage (URL, Body, User-Agent) gegen Angriffssignaturen — SQL-Injection, XSS, Path Traversal, Command Injection — und blockiert die Anfrage, bevor sie Ihre Website erreicht. Engine und Basis-Regeln sind in jedem Tarif kostenlos."

