#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:5721
#: admin/class-setup-wizard.php:1621
msgid "From email"
msgstr "Absender-E-Mail"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:5733
#: admin/class-setup-wizard.php:1633
msgid "Used as Reply-To so replies reach your inbox directly. With the PRO mail relay, mails are sent from noreply@reportedip.com, so any address you enter here is safe to use."
msgstr "Wird als Reply-To verwendet, damit Antworten direkt in Ihrem Postfach ankommen. Mit dem PRO-Mail-Relay werden E-Mails von noreply@reportedip.com versendet, sodass jede hier eingetragene Adresse unbedenklich ist."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:5735
#: admin/class-setup-wizard.php:1635
